<p>The Morton County Fair Association was incorporated in July 1895 with {% person "george-harmon" %}George Harmon{% endperson %} as president, {% person "andrew-e-thorberg" %}A. E. Thorberg{% endperson %} as vice president, and {% person "c-l-timmerman" %}C. L. Timmerman{% endperson %} as secretary. {% person "t-c-kennelly" %}T. C. Kennelly{% endperson %}, {% person "w-s-barrows" %}W. S. Barrows{% endperson %}, and Elijah Boley prepared the articles of incorporation.</p>

