<p>Local businesses typically donated prizes. The fair was successful both financially and in terms of regional participation. Receipts totaled $4,181 and covered its expenses. The fair featured roping and horse-racing events. The 1904 North Dakota State Fair was the last to permit roping large range steers.</p>

