<p>As vice president of the State Fair Association and a prominent horse rancher from Flasher, {% person "stephen-p-weekes" %}Stephen P. Weekes{% endperson %} was instrumental in developing the event, along with his sons {% person "steve-weekes" %}Steve{% endperson %} and {% person "charlie-weekes" %}Charlie{% endperson %}. Weekes's son-in-law, {% person "max-theil" %}Max Theil{% endperson %}, created the "Heart River Roundup" around 1918. {% person "badlands-bill-mccarty", "Badlands Bill McCarty" %}"Badlands Bill" McCarty{% endperson %} joined the association and began promoting the name "Mandan Roundup" in 1923.</p>
